  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing inequities in Health and Nutrition in Beni Mellal-Khenifra Region, Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To Help reduce maternal, neonatal, child mortality and morbidity by improving access and utilization of quality maternal and child health and nutrition services&#xBCA0;&#xB2C8;&#xBA5C;&#xB784; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC758;&#xB8CC;&#xCCB4;&#xACC4;&#xB97C; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xD558;&#xC5EC; &#xC591;&#xC9C8;&#xC758; &#xBAA8;&#xC790;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xBC0F; &#xC601;&#xC591;&#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xC774; &#xC99D;&#xAC00;&#xD568;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce preventable maternal, newborn, and child mortality, Strengthen management of primary medical facility quality of care standards, 1)Improve the drinking water hygiene (WASH) environment in primary medical facilities, 2)implement a 1,000 day nutrition improvement program (facilitation of breast milk, promotion of essential micronutrient intake) and 3) promote integrated maternal and child health programs such as inducing community behavioral change using digital platforms and promoting participation of maternal and child health stakeholders</narrative>
  </description>
